+   - 規範: $\sqrt{2^2 + 3^2} = \sqrt{13}$、 そして $\sqrt{4^2 + 6^2} = \sqrt{52} = 2\sqrt{13}$  
    - $\cos(\theta) = \tfrac{26}{\sqrt{13} \cdot 2\sqrt{13}} = \tfrac{26}{26} = 1$  
    - $\theta = 0^\circ$  
-   These vectors are multiples, so they align perfectly.
