-- Lengths: $\sqrt{(\tfrac{1}{\sqrt{2}})^2 + (\tfrac{1}{\sqrt{2}})^2} = \sqrt{\tfrac{1}{2} + \tfrac{1}{2}} = 1$  
+- 内積: $(\tfrac{1}{\sqrt{2}})(-\tfrac{1}{\sqrt{2}}) + (\tfrac{1}{\sqrt{2}})(\tfrac{1}{\sqrt{2}}) = -\tfrac{1}{2} + \tfrac{1}{2} = 0$  
