-2. Trace: $\text{tr}(A) = \text{tr}(B)$.
-3. Rank: $\text{rank}(A) = \text{rank}(B)$.
-4. Eigenvalues: Same set of eigenvalues (with multiplicity).
-5. Characteristic polynomial: Identical.
-6. Minimal polynomial: Identical.
